-- title:
--   An ideal generated by weighted-homogeneous polynomials is homogeneous
-- statement:
--   If every polynomial in a family is weighted-homogeneous of the same degree, its generated ideal is homogeneous for the corresponding weighted grading.
-- source:
--   openai/math Ampleness stack: WeightedIdealCurveBound implies eps-ample exceptional twist, hence Serre vanishing and eventual generation of I^n by weight ≤ n(rho+eps) sections.

